From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:04:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] olecli, compobj and ole2disp (16 bit): client documents,
 CoCreateInstance, variant conversion

OleEnumObjects ends at once, the OLE 1 create/query functions report that no object can be created, CoCreateInstance16 asks the class factory of an in-process server, CoDisconnectObject succeeds, VariantChangeType/Ex convert the scalar and BSTR variants through oleaut32, SetErrorInfo clears the error info.

Unverified: no 16 bit runtime or compiler is available here, so this is compile-checked only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

